<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT-Geo, Hogar downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Geo, Hogar downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The OBSA-Serfin brokerage has lowered housing builders Corporacion Geo and Consorcio Hogar to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Gerardo Saenz wrote in a research report that the change was mainly because &quot;excellent price performance&quot; in the two stocks had undermined their potential for further gains.</p>
<p>-- Geo was flat at 48.80 pesos on the Mexican bolsa.</p>
<p>-- Hogar fell 32 centavos to 14.48 pesos.</p>
<p>(( -- Daniel Perez, Monterrey bureau +528 345-7617))</p>
